    "U.S. refinery utilization remained high throughout the observed interval, roughly 96-97 percent.",
    "Distillate net production remained around 5.2-5.4 million barrels per day rather than collapsing.",
    "Weekly distillate exports materially exceeded imports throughout the interval and increased through August 7 before retreating in the August 14 week.",
